Error: Jet.UseCycle: The re-export `left.shout` leads back to itself
  --> Tests/UI/reexport_chain_cycle.jet:4:5
    |
  4 |     shout: right.shout
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Each re-export names the one its target names, so the chain `left.shout` → `right.shout` → `left.shout` never reaches a function
 Fix: Point one re-export in the loop at the module that declares the function
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UseCycle
